Maintainer: NetTact <support@nettact.org>
Architecture: all
Description: LuCI interface for the NetTact monitoring agent.
 Configure the server address and enrollment token, choose whether the agent
 binary lives in RAM or on flash, pick or pin a version, and watch the service's
 status and recent log output.
